<title>ROMANIA: ROMANIA - WEATHER - JULY 22.</title>
<headline>ROMANIA - WEATHER - JULY 22.</headline>
<text>
<p>TUESDAY, JULY 22</p>
<p>- Unstable weather conditions across the country, with rainfalls especially in the northern and mountain areas. Occassional showers in the south. Temp 18 to 28 C. (Source: National Meteorological Institute)</p>
